; xpad98 - Windows XP and Vista, x86 and x64: Xbox One and Series (GIP) pads
; only (gamepad.md 1, 4.5, 8). XBCD serves 360-protocol pads there.
;
; The VID/PID lists below are the Xbox 360, receiver and Xbox One rows of
; xpad_device[] in Linux drivers/input/joystick/xpad.c, torvalds/linux
; commit a804c5742bff224d4cb4d25dd383554d598be32b (Copyright (c) 2002
; Marko Friedemann and the others named in that file), less the 25 ids of
; Masahiko Morii's x360c and the keyboards/keypads marked XP_F_NOINF in
; devtab.c. infchk.ps1 checks them against devtab.c.
; Copyright (C) 2026 Yeo Kheng Meng
; Experimental build; not released, not tested on a guest.
